$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tyr's Cradle\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Lush\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Noon\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes have established bases and face one and other in close quarters with a tower between them.  With both teams main generators buried the turret generators are the vulrable energy source.  Capture the Central tower for the power to bombard the enemy with dual mortar turrets.  8 captures win.  Map By: [HvC]Leviathan";
$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
